  "contentval": "0003Fzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHu/201",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">작년 5-6월 주문해서 사용하고 남은 검정말을 학교 연못에 던져두었어요. <br>1년 정도 지난 오늘 검정말을 건져내어 관찰합니다. </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be7ec70cf667089504485cfcf22f1e117dc19e40\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/be7ec70cf667089504485cfcf22f1e117dc19e40\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"><div class=\"figcaption\">학교 연못</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c72ad2256acb00cfeb6aeacfddc0ccda68c0b9ce\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c72ad2256acb00cfeb6aeacfddc0ccda68c0b9ce\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"><div class=\"figcaption\">검정말이 자라서 땅에 뿌리를 내림(!!)</div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8154fc7c4367af3d4203f6bb0e6cc1a4adb7236d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8154fc7c4367af3d4203f6bb0e6cc1a4adb7236d\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">검정말과 초록색 실처럼 생긴 녹조류를 함께 관찰합니다.<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14c3d3f8e6663d075e0574a6089709418f8c456c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/14c3d3f8e6663d075e0574a6089709418f8c456c\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">검정말의 엽록체가 잘 보입니다. <br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54cb48b274cf29edeeff457921a56dd068ff763d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/54cb48b274cf29edeeff457921a56dd068ff763d\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">녹조류 처음 관찰해봤는데 아주 잘 보입니다. <br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5d9f10c2443d3853345fc67583970c5dd575046\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5d9f10c2443d3853345fc67583970c5dd575046\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">녹조류의 포자도 관찰할 수 있었어요. <br><br><br>그런데 채집한 연못 물 속에서 꿈틀거리는 길이 약 5mm 미만의 동물체를 발견..!! 현미경으로 관찰합니다…<br><br><br><br><br><br>(사진 주의)<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf6209f76b1f672004978c8086cddd735bc8a929\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf6209f76b1f672004978c8086cddd735bc8a929\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/41ea1bf71b74dc83d1e2fa93f5a1f05ccd7a3e5b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/41ea1bf71b74dc83d1e2fa93f5a1f05ccd7a3e5b\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"360\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br><br><br>살아 있어서 덮개유리 아래에서 계속 꿈틀거리며 이동합니다..  <br>구글 이미지 검색을 해보니 깔따구 유충이라고 하네요. 처음 관찰해보아서 신기했어요.. ㅎㅎ<br><br>자유학기 주제선택 수업에서 연못물 관찰!! 해 보면 좋을 듯 합니다. <br><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}